WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.886
The Carters were visiting Hawk Valley.

2
00:00:05.887 --> 00:00:10.002
"My class had a field trip here," Harry said.

3
00:00:10.003 --> 00:00:14.431
"We saw hawks soaring through the air."

4
00:00:14.432 --> 00:00:20.103
At the visitors' center, the Carters learned about hawks.

5
00:00:20.104 --> 00:00:23.999
They saw lots of photos.

6
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.398
"I can't wait to see a hawk!" Emmy said.

7
00:00:28.399 --> 00:00:34.829
"They look beautiful in flight."

8
00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:41.191
The Carters hiked through the woods to a lookout spot.

9
00:00:41.192 --> 00:00:49.257
They scanned the valley below and the sky above.

10
00:00:49.258 --> 00:00:53.736
"I don't see any hawks," Emmy said.

11
00:00:53.737 --> 00:00:58.604
"Keep watching," Mom said.

12
00:00:58.605 --> 00:01:01.343
Oliver pointed to the sky.

13
00:01:01.344 --> 00:01:06.486
"Is that a hawk up there?"

14
00:01:06.487 --> 00:01:10.679
"No, that's an airplane," Dad said.

15
00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:16.419
Emmy sighed. "I still don't see any hawks."

16
00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:19.298
But she kept watching.

17
00:01:19.299 --> 00:01:26.058
Suddenly Emmy spotted two hawks circling in the air.

18
00:01:26.059 --> 00:01:28.593
"Wow!" she said.

19
00:01:28.594 --> 00:01:32.925
"They're flying without flapping their wings!"

20
00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:37.452
"They're floating on air currents," Harry said.

21
00:01:37.453 --> 00:01:41.161
Another hawk landed on a tree.

22
00:01:41.162 --> 00:01:45.950
Emmy used Dad's binoculars to get a better look.

23
00:01:45.951 --> 00:01:51.034
"That hawk is looking all around," she said.

24
00:01:51.035 --> 00:01:55.445
"I wonder what it's watching."

25
00:01:55.446 --> 00:02:00.195
The bird lifted its wings and took off.

26
00:02:00.196 --> 00:02:04.450
Emmy turned to hand the binoculars to Dad.

27
00:02:04.451 --> 00:02:08.711
She spotted something in the woods behind him.

28
00:02:08.712 --> 00:02:12.378
"Look, everybody!" Emmy whispered.

29
00:02:12.379 --> 00:02:15.624
"We are watching hawks.

30
00:02:15.625 --> 00:02:20.938
And those deer are watching us!"

